    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW27oqPCvdzeTYTkvu97pXPrx)_\n\n**Before:** copying text from the echo area meant `C-h e`, then selecting by hand.\n\n**After:** `M-x sp-copy-last-message` copies the last line logged in `*Messages*` to the kill ring and echoes what it copied. It signals a `user-error` if there is nothing to copy. A message the echo area showed without logging it cannot be recovered. No key binding yet.\n\n- Code in `libraries/modules/funct/sp-helper-funct.el`, documented and tangled from `docs/tangles/funct/sp-helper-funct.org`.\n- CHANGELOG entry added.\n\n**Not checked:** not run in Emacs (none in the container).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_018tY6HXx7GALBEQXsLZm9YU)_",
